|---------|----------|--------|----------|
| No HTTPS | HIGH | Man-in-the-middle attacks | Attackers can intercept data |
| No Rate Limiting | MEDIUM | DoS/DDoS vulnerability | Unlimited request abuse |
| No Input Validation | LOW | Injection potential | Malformed requests cause errors |
