## 🔒 Security Checklist for Secrets

Setup before deployment:

- [ ] `.env` file is in `.gitignore`
- [ ] `.env.example` is committed to document required secrets
- [ ] Secrets are generated using approved mechanisms (openssl, Vault, KMS, etc.)
- [ ] Secret rotation is defined and automated
- [ ] Secrets are rotated regularly
- [ ] Secrets are not logged (removed from console.log, console.error)
- [ ] Secrets are not stored in version control
- [ ] CI/CD pipelines properly handle secrets
- [ ] Production secrets never exposed in URLs, logs, or documentation
- [ ] Secrets are validated before usage

